## 📚 Key Python Concepts

| Concept             | Example                         |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| String              | `"Hello Python"`                |
| Tuple               | `(10, 20, 30)`                  |
| Indexing            | `text[0]`                       |
| Slicing             | `text[1:5]`                     |
| Length              | `len(text)`                     |
| Count               | `text.count("a")`               |
| Replace             | `text.replace("Python", "SQL")` |
| Tuple Concatenation | `tuple1 + tuple2`               |
| Tuple Repetition    | `tuple1 * 3`                    |

